    <h2>DQ Pretzel Sticks — A Premium Snack</h2>
  <p>The DQ Pretzel Sticks with Zesty Queso is a warm soft pretzel experience in a fast-food context. The pretzels are served warm with a bold, slightly spicy queso dipping sauce. The queso adds a savory, cheesy depth that elevates the standard pretzel into something more satisfying as a snack or a side. At $3.99, they are also eligible for the <a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match</a>. Find the full snacks lineup on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>Pretzel Sticks vs. Cheese Curds — Which to Order?</h2>
  <p>The choice between Pretzel Sticks and <a href="/items/cheese-curds">Cheese Curds</a> (both $3.99, both ~440–470 cal) comes down to preference:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Pretzel Sticks</strong> — Soft and chewy pretzel with bold queso on the side. The dipping sauce is the star. Great for guests who like dipping and bread-adjacent snacks.</li>
    <li><strong>Cheese Curds</strong> — Fried cheese nuggets — the flavor and texture is all about the gooey melted cheddar inside. More indulgent, no separate dip required.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Best Pairings</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Pair with a <a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">cheeseburger</a> as a side instead of fries — same budget range, more interesting</li>
    <li>Order as part of the <a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match</a> paired with a Chili Dog for a $5.00 complete snack meal</li>
    <li>Share as an appetizer before the main order</li>
  </ul>
